# 16. Easy Memory

```text
setState()
    ↓
Local state

Provider
    ↓
Shared state

ChangeNotifier
    ↓
Stores/manages state

notifyListeners()
    ↓
Tells UI that state changed

Consumer
    ↓
Listens to provider
```

### Main idea

```text
UI
 ↓
Provider
 ↓
State changes
 ↓
notifyListeners()
 ↓
UI rebuilds
```

You don't need to memorize every Provider method right now. First understand the **state → change → notify → UI update** flow.
